---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import VideoBg from "../components/VideoBg.astro";
---

<Layout title="Biogrify">
  <Nav />
  <section class="hero biogrify">
    <div class="content__wrapper case"></div>
  </section>
  <section class="work white">
    <div class="work_wrapper">
      <div class="work-title">
        <h2 class="h2">BIOGRIFY</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="work_details">
        <ul role="list" class="list-2 work w-list-unstyled">
          <li class="list-title work">
            <div>SERVICES</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">BRANDING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">COPYWRITING</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">VISUAL DESIGN</div>
          </li>
          <li class="list-item">
            <div class="service case">UI/UX</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="work_intro">
          <p>Where’s the digital publishing platform for fiction lovers?<br><br>Whether a reader of fiction or a writer of fiction, there’s very limited options when it comes to digital self-publishing. Biogrify is the place where factual storytellers can finally share their stories.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3646-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-layout work_grid wf-layout-layout">
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3647-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/biogrify-poster_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/biogrify-poster_1biogrify-poster.webp 500w, /images/biogrify-poster_1biogrify-poster.webp 800w, /images/biogrify-poster_1biogrify-poster.webp 1080w, /images/biogrify-poster_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3653-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/biogrify-tags.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd365f-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/biogrify-billboard.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3669-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/biogrify-posters.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/biogrify-posters-p-500.jpg 500w, /images/biogrify-posters-p-800.jpg 800w, /images/biogrify-posters-p-1080.jpg 1080w, /images/biogrify-posters-p-1600.jpg 1600w, /images/biogrify-posters-p-2000.jpg 2000w, /images/biogrify-posters-p-2600.jpg 2600w, /images/biogrify-posters.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd3675-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/biogrify-reveal.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/biogrify-reveal-p-500.png 500w, /images/biogrify-reveal-p-800.png 800w, /images/biogrify-reveal-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/biogrify-reveal.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_2a09d7d0-9076-efa0-4d7a-afcd2a4706fe-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/biogrify-books.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_94f218bf-7c86-48a2-7318-804d19e60b76-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell">
          <div class="work_text">
            <p>What’s unique about Biogrify is that writers can publish their stories slowly, chapter by chapter. The logo mark is based on a dinkus, a symbol which indicates a break or change in a story for the reader.<br><br>“Reveal their story or write your own, what’s your next chapter?”</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_22d03663-465a-b34d-3b68-d52cd04ab966-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/biogrify-home.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36ad-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/biogrify-mobile.mp4" img="/images/video-large.webp" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/video-large-p-500.png 500w, /images/video-large-p-800.png 800w, /images/video-large-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/video-large-p-1600.png 1600w, /images/video-large-p-2000.png 2000w, /images/video-large-p-2600.png 2600w, /images/video-large.webp 3000w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-_78c4b266-a05d-ee7a-e27b-c4f677bd36b9-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/biogrify-book_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/biogrify-book_1biogrify-book.webp 500w, /images/biogrify-book_1biogrify-book.webp 800w, /images/biogrify-book_1biogrify-book.webp 1080w, /images/biogrify-book_1.webp 1440w" alt=""></div>
        <div id="w-node-_2b94b5c1-a98c-7ca1-8bd9-b8cad26c8702-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell">
          <VideoBg video="https://pub-6e9c9d0558e94619893e3ae1137eeec8.r2.dev/videos/biogrify-mark.mp4" img="/images/work-1.webp" sizes="(max-width: 1600px) 90vw, 1440px" srcset="/images/work-1-p-500.png 500w, /images/work-1-p-800.png 800w, /images/work-1-p-1080.png 1080w, /images/work-1.webp 1440w" />
        </div>
        <div id="w-node-c919498d-959b-1740-bc47-c06d766d59dd-b40f4a2a" class="w-layout-cell"><img src="/images/biogriphy-chapter_1.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 3333px) 90vw, 3000px" srcset="/images/biogriphy-chapter_1biogriphy-chapter.webp 500w, /images/biogriphy-chapter_1biogriphy-chapter.webp 800w, /images/biogriphy-chapter_1biogriphy-chapter.webp 1080w, /images/biogriphy-chapter_1biogriphy-chapter.webp 1600w, /images/biogriphy-chapter_1biogriphy-chapter.webp 2000w, /images/biogriphy-chapter_1.webp 3000w" alt=""></div>
      </div>
      <div id="footer-line" class="footer-trigger"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
